WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.056
Yuliy? Don't be reckless,

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.726
-this isn't a circus!
-Can you get closer to their car?

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.477
That's what I'm doing!

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.245
-Damn it! Hurry up and go, Fallon!
-Give me a minute!

00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:27.837
You dirty Jaeger!

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.980
It can't be. You're Sirius.

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:02.497
The Royals...

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:05.333
Yuliy!

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.461
Don't pursue this any further. Yuliy!

